{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026tAvxL3Eh3B1792912135.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>人稱「沈大師」的股評人沈振盈離世，終年66歲。</p><p></p><p>沈振盈的胞妹沈振珊，在社交平台發訃文，指沈振盈昨晚，於律敦治醫院離世，家屬正著手處理沈振盈身後事，喪禮及追思安排，待落實細節後再公布。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.SHUM-1500.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ZSKRKLubqI1792912233.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>據了解，沈振盈昨晚7時許，於朋友在灣仔的住所聚餐後離開，在駱克道的士站突然暈倒，途人報警，救護員到場將他送院，延至晚上約9時不治。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T08:23:46.845517+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T06:34:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T09:38:10.171208+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T08:20:13.004607+00:00","content_hash":"69222ea728300b2c0a9d7375a9e9d871b54455bb4cacd2574fa56821aedc037d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-25T08:23:46.845517+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}